lede="The histories, knowledges, cultures and rights of the world's Indigenous peoples: from the Americas, the Pacific, Australia, the Arctic, Africa and Asia; colonisation and resistance; land, language and law; Indigenous knowledge and science; and self-determination today. About 250 to 300 hours over ten to twelve months.",
